<%- include('partials/header', { fullWidth: true, metaDescription: 'Support and funding for canoe polo clubs and teams anywhere in the world: who to contact, ways to raise money, and where to find grants.' }) %>
<% const ext = (url) => url ? `href="${url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"` : ''; %>

<div class="page-banner">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Support and funding</p>
    <h1>Support and funding</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap support-grid">
  <nav class="support-toc" aria-label="On this page">
    <h2>On this page</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><a href="#help">Finding support</a></li>
      <li><a href="#fundraising">Raising money</a></li>
      <li><a href="#grants">Grant routes</a>
        <ol>
          <% GRANTS.forEach(g => { %><li><a href="#<%= g.id %>"><%= g.region %></a></li><% }) %>
        </ol>
      </li>
      <li><a href="#tips">Applying for a grant</a></li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <div class="support-main">
    <p class="intro-text">Running a canoe polo club or taking a team abroad costs money: boats, goals, pool or lake time, coaching courses and travel. Wherever you are in the world, this page shows who can help and how clubs fund themselves.</p>

    <section id="help" class="support-section">
      <h2 class="sub-head">Finding support</h2>
      <p>Your national canoe federation is the best first contact. Most have development staff who can help with coaching, safeguarding, insurance and funding applications. Every country's federation is listed in the <a href="https://paddleworldwide.com/national-federations" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Paddle Worldwide directory</a>.</p>
      <table class="data-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Organisation</th><th>Covers</th><th>How they can help</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <% ORGANISATIONS.forEach(o => { %>
          <tr>
            <td class="dt-name"><a <%- ext(o.url) %>><%= o.name %></a></td>
            <td class="dt-area"><%= o.area %></td>
            <td><%= o.help %></td>
          </tr>
        <% }) %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <h3 class="region-head">Canoe polo in some of the biggest polo countries</h3>
      <ul class="nat-list">
        <% NATIONAL.forEach(n => { %><li><span><%= n.country %></span><a <%- ext(n.url) %>><%= n.name %></a></li><% }) %>
      </ul>
      <p class="small-note">Also worth contacting: your local council's sports office, nearby clubs (for shared training, spare boats and referees) and universities with canoe polo teams.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="fundraising" class="support-section">
      <h2 class="sub-head">Raising money</h2>
      <p>Most clubs combine a few regular income sources with one or two bigger fundraisers a year.</p>
      <dl class="idea-list">
        <% FUNDRAISING.forEach(f => { %>
          <div><dt><%= f.title %></dt><dd><%= f.text %></dd></div>
        <% }) %>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section id="grants" class="support-section">
      <h2 class="sub-head">Grant routes</h2>
      <p>Grants for sport change often. Start with the worldwide and continental routes, then look for the same kinds of fund in your own country. Amounts and dates were last checked in <strong><%= LAST_CHECKED %></strong>. Always confirm on the funder's own website before applying.</p>

      <% GRANTS.forEach(g => { %>
      <h3 id="<%= g.id %>" class="region-head"><%= g.region %></h3>
      <% if (g.note) { %><p class="small-note"><%= g.note %></p><% } %>
      <table class="data-table grants">
        <thead><tr><th>Programme</th><th>Who it's for</th><th>Amount</th><th>Timing</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <% g.items.forEach(i => { %>
          <tr>
            <td class="dt-name"><% if (i.url) { %><a <%- ext(i.url) %>><%= i.name %></a><% } else { %><%= i.name %><% } %></td>
            <td><%= i.who %></td>
            <td class="dt-amount"><%= i.amount || '-' %></td>
            <td class="dt-when"><%= i.when || '-' %></td>
          </tr>
        <% }) %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <% }) %>
    </section>

    <section id="tips" class="support-section">
      <h2 class="sub-head">Applying for a grant</h2>
      <ol class="tips">
        <% TIPS.forEach(t => { %><li><%= t %></li><% }) %>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <aside class="side-note support-cta">
      <h2>Know a fund we've missed?</h2>
      <p>If your club has had a grant or found a good fundraising idea, tell us and we'll add it so other clubs can benefit.</p>
      <p><a href="https://wa.me/353876789927?text=Funding%20suggestion" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Message us a suggestion on WhatsApp</a></p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
